# Adding a profile on the desktop (sfdesk add_profile.mbt, the web's pages/AddProfile.tsx): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the
# made-up chat. Profile from the rail, 添加 Profile: the station it is added on, the machine's own login, the providers.
timeout 30000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap icon:quota
wait 1200
tap 添加 Profile
wait 1500
wait 1200
exit
